Description: Lock your PC when your Bluetooth device walks away
 BlueLock watches a paired phone (or other Bluetooth device) and locks your
 session when it moves away: by BLE distance, by the connection signal of a
 connected phone, or when the device disappears. Includes a tray icon for
 picking the device, calibration and debug mode.

